                                "sense_id": "0e05fc04-4522-3f43-9082-36d682749ee6",
                                "text": "His broad-brim was placed beside him; his legs were stiffly crossed; his drab vesture was buttoned up to his chin; and spectacles on nose, he seemed absorbed in reading from a ponderous volume."
                            },
